@mod_info
title: Mod info

= The Dawn of APRA

**Setting:** Peru, 1985–1992

**Player:** Alan García and the APRA government.

Manage party factions, economic policy, public support, military relations and the insurgency.

Your decisions will shape Peru's political future.

- @start_menu_2: Return to main menu
